    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur chante et attaque l’ennemi.\nSi plusieurs Pokémon déclenchent cette\nattaque à la suite, l’effet augmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with a\nsong. Others can join in the Round and\nmake the attack do greater damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/11/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with a\nsong. Others can join in the Round and\nmake the attack do greater damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "black-2-white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/14/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "うたで　あいてを　こうげきする。\nみんなで　つかうと　れんぞくで\nだせて　いりょくも　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "노래로 상대를 공격한다.\n함께 돌림노래를 하면 계속해서\n쓸 수 있고 위력도 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur attaque l’ennemi en chantant.\nSi plusieurs Pokémon déclenchent cette attaque\nà la suite, l’effet augmente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Angriff mit Gesang. Singt der Anwender mit allen\nim Kanon, kann er die Attacke mehrfach auslösen\nund die Stärke steigt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quien lo usa ataca con una afilada garra de\nsombras. Su índice de golpe crítico es muy alto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attacca il bersaglio con una melodia. Se usata\ndurante lo stesso turno da più Pokémon, i danni\ninflitti aumentano.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks the target with a song.\nOthers can join in the Round and make\nthe attack do greater damage.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "歌で　相手を　攻撃する。\nみんなで　輪唱すると　続けて\nだすことが　でき　威力も　あがる。",
